{"03_After_10th_ITI_Trades/00_About_ITI_Telangana":{"title":"ITI – Industrial Training Institutes (Telangana)","sub":"Career Guidance – Telangana (India)","s":[{"h":"What is ITI?","b":[{"t":"li","x":"Skill-based trade courses of 1 or 2 years under the Craftsmen Training Scheme (CTS)."},{"t":"li","x":"Managed in Telangana by the Department of Employment & Training (DET); national standard by DGT (NCVT)."},{"t":"li","x":"Govt ITIs have very low fees; many private ITIs also exist."}]},{"h":"Admission","b":[{"t":"li","x":"Online application at the Telangana ITI admissions portal (usually June–August)."},{"t":"li","x":"Selection on merit of 10th marks (no entrance test); district-wise counselling."},{"t":"li","x":"Age: minimum 14 years."}]},{"h":"Trades list (see each folder)","b":[{"t":"table","h":["#","Trade","Duration","Eligibility"],"r":[["1","Electrician","2 yrs","10th with Science & Maths"],["2","Fitter","2 yrs","10th with Science & Maths"],["3","Electronics Mechanic","2 yrs","10th with Science & Maths"],["4","Computer Operator & Programming Assistant (COPA)","1 yr","10th"],["5","Mechanic Motor Vehicle (MMV)","2 yrs","10th with Science & Maths"],["6","Welder (Gas & Electric)","1 yr","8th/10th"],["7","Plumber","1 yr","8th/10th"],["8","Draughtsman (Civil)","2 yrs","10th with Science & Maths"],["9","Draughtsman (Mechanical)","2 yrs","10th with Science & Maths"],["10","Turner","2 yrs","10th with Science & Maths"],["11","Machinist","2 yrs","10th with Science & Maths"],["12","Refrigeration & Air-Conditioning Technician","2 yrs","10th with Science & Maths"],["13","Wireman","2 yrs","8th/10th"],["14","Mechanic Diesel","1 yr","10th"],["15","Sewing Technology / Dress Making","1 yr","8th/10th"]]}]},{"h":"Pass Percentage","b":[{"t":"table","h":["Item","Typical pass requirement (NCVT/AITT – CTS)"],"r":[["Trade Practical","~60%"],["Trade Theory, Workshop Calculation & Science, Engineering Drawing, Employability Skills","~33% each"],["Attendance","80% needed to sit the exam"]]},{"